MOSS Blind Layout Check by alphaBell.

The layout parser is the unchanged alphaBell browser adaptation from MOSS
Layout Studio. Its compiler behavior follows OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image revision
52b87fca23acedc399d062d593bec388aee9926a, licensed under Apache-2.0.
The standalone Space is built from the same canonical source and does not
maintain a separate scoring implementation.

OpenMOSS publisher models referenced by the evaluator:
https://huggingface.co/OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Image-Base
https://huggingface.co/OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Image-SFT

The Space includes no model weights, publisher example images or user image
bytes. Users choose their own images locally; only hashes and manual
annotations appear in a downloaded result.

Source reference:
https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image/blob/52b87fca23acedc399d062d593bec388aee9926a/skills/moss-image-prompt-enhancer/scripts/compile_prompt.py
